<title>NEW ZEALAND: Home Mortgage Co cuts NZ floating rate to 9.95 pct.</title>
<headline>Home Mortgage Co cuts NZ floating rate to 9.95 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Home Mortgage Company on Wednesday announced a reduction in its New Zealand variable mortgage interest rate to 9.95 percent from 10.75 percent, commencing January 30, 1997.</p>
<p>The Home Mortgage Company is a WestpacTrust subsidiary which purchased mortgage portfolios from Mortgage Corp and Housing Corp of NZ earlier this year.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
